#: Thesaurus.cpp:640
msgid ""
"<b>Error:</b> Failed to execute WordNet program 'wn'. WordNet has to be "
"installed on your computer if you want to use it, and 'wn' has to be in your "
"PATH. You can get WordNet at <a href=\"http://wordnet.princeton.edu/"
"\">http://wordnet.princeton.edu/</a>. Note that WordNet only supports the "
"English language."
msgstr ""
"<b>Greška:</b> Nije uspeo da izvrši WordNet program \"wn '. WordNet mora da "
"bude instaliran na vašem računaru ako želite da ga koristite, i \"wn\" mora "
"biti u stazi. Možete dobiti WordNet  na  <a href=\"http://wordnet.princeton."
"edu/\">http://wordnet.princeton.edu/</a>. Imajte na umu da WordNet podržava "
"samo engleski jezik."

